[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0342","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0342.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0417","title":"Cayman 3220-H DSL Router 管理界面拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cayman 3220-H DSL Router 的管理接口存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 HTTP 管理界面提交超长的用户名或密码字符串，触发路由器处理异常导致服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 Cayman 3220-H DSL Router 1.0 及 GatorSurf 5.3 等版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。攻击者只需构造特制的 HTTP 请求即可实施攻击，利用门槛低，可导致路由器管理功能暂时不可用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0417"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-17T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:40.330","remediation":"该设备为 2000 年发布的已停产产品，厂商不再提供安全更新。建议将设备升级至支持安全认证的替代产品；如无法替换，可在路由器管理界面中限制管理端口仅允许内网可信 IP 访问，并在上游防火墙配置规则拦截对 TCP 80/443 端口的公网访问，同时设置合理的密码长度限制避免超长字符串触发 DoS。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0075.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0280.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1219","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19923","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0417.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0417","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0417.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0417.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c62h-wfv7-hw42/GHSA-c62h-wfv7-hw42.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0417.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001388.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a8de6680-f4ba-4315-95ac-f367e3dcd504.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0342.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0342.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0342.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0304","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0304.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0350","title":"Internet Security Systems NetworkICE ICEcap 默认用户名和密码漏洞","description":"NetworkICE ICEcap 2.0.23 及更早版本中存在调试功能默认开启的安全缺陷，该功能允许未经身份认证的远程攻击者绕过脆弱的认证机制，向目标系统发送未加密的事件数据。攻击者无需任何权限即可通过网络远程利用此漏洞，利用难度较低。成功利用后，攻击者可篡改或注入虚假事件信息，影响系统日志的完整性和可靠性，但不会直接导致数据机密性泄露或系统可用性受损。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0350"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-17T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:32.053","remediation":"立即禁用 ICEcap Manager 的调试功能（debugging feature），修改所有默认用户名和密码为强密码。在防火墙上限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 ICEcap 管理端口（默认 5000/tcp）。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的替代方案（如 Microsoft System Center Operations Manager 或 SolarWinds 等现代网络监控平台）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://advice.networkice.com/advice/Support/KB/q000166/","http://www.osvdb.org/312","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1216","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=2220","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19922","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0350.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0350","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0350.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0350.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3xrw-8rrf-5qr9/GHSA-3xrw-8rrf-5qr9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0350.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/icecap_default_pw.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0304.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0304.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0304.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1008","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0391","title":"MIT Kerberos 5 krshd 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Kerberos 5 中的远程 shell 服务 krshd 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的网络请求，触发缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Kerberos 5 相关部署环境，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击复杂度低且无需用户交互。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0391"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:37.100","remediation":"立即升级 MIT Kerberos 5 至 1.2 及以上版本，该版本已修复 krshd 缓冲区溢出漏洞。Red Hat 用户应安装 RHSA-2000-025 提供的更新包。如无法升级，可在 inetd 配置中禁用 krshd 服务（注释掉 kshell 行）并重启 inetd，同时通过防火墙限制对 544 端口（krb5-shell）的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0184.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-05/0295.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-06.html","http://www.osvdb.org/4876","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-025.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1220","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0391.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0391","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0391.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0391.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r8jx-rgwf-cw4w/GHSA-r8jx-rgwf-cw4w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/anonymous-55443259/CVE_Vul_File_Localization/blob/24756649f99ff5cea566f1e66a7fdd2ed0e7aced/Result/repository/repository_collection/repo_from_gpt/result/CVE-2000-0391/final.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c452f44c-d7d5-46cb-95f1-c198f368b7d7.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1006","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0390","title":"MIT Kerberos 5 krb425_conv_principal 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Kerberos 5 认证协议中的 krb425_conv_principal 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送特制的 Kerberos 请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现任意代码执行并以 root 权限完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响多个 Kerberos 5 实现版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0390"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36.973","remediation":"升级 MIT Kerberos 5 至 1.2 或更高版本，该漏洞在 krb5-1.2 中已修复。Red Hat 用户应安装 RHSA-2000-025 提供的更新包。如无法升级，可在 krb425_conv_principal 函数调用处添加输入长度检查，限制 Kerberos 4 主体名称长度不超过缓冲区大小，防止栈溢出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0184.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-05/0295.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-06.html","http://www.osvdb.org/4884","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-025.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1220","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0390.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0390","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0390.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0390.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hw2f-876w-6xvx/GHSA-hw2f-876w-6xvx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/anonymous-55443259/CVE_Vul_File_Localization/blob/24756649f99ff5cea566f1e66a7fdd2ed0e7aced/Result/repository/repository_collection/repo_from_gpt/result/CVE-2000-0390/final.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0c533c05-f7db-41cd-afdb-deed1471a5da.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0414","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0414.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0392","title":"MIT Kerberos 5 ksu 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Kerberos 5 认证协议套件中的 ksu 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 ksu 程序发送特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖内存中的关键数据，成功利用此漏洞可获得目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Kerberos 5 的多个发行版本，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级高。建议用户及时升级到修复版本以消除风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0392"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:37.220","remediation":"立即升级 MIT Kerberos 5 至 1.1.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ksu 缓冲区溢出漏洞。Red Hat 用户请安装 RHSA-2000-025 提供的更新包。如无法升级，可移除 ksu 的 setuid 权限作为临时缓解：chmod u-s /usr/kerberos/bin/ksu。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0184.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-05/0295.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-06.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-025.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1220","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0392.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0392","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643