.securityfocus.com/bid/1215","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19921","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0432.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0432","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0432.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0432.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/882.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-chpc-74wh-x234/GHSA-chpc-74wh-x234.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/e7a1e0098ca50c8dc77455488033ca407ec81282/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/bailehang/snort_2.2.0/blob/34f8a3a85f15645aea53d6e0d46863c7c57e43ef/doc/signatures/1455.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0432.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0354.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0354.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0354.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0331","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0331.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0405","title":"L0pht AntiSniff DNS响应包缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"L0pht AntiSniff（也称 Stake AntiSniff）1.0.1 版本及 Researchers 1.0 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的 DNS 响应数据包，触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而覆盖返回地址或函数指针，导致任意代码执行。成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统，获取最高权限。由于 AntiSniff 作为网络嗅探与安全检测工具常运行在特权模式下，该漏洞危害严重，CVSS 评分 10.0。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0405"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:38.847","remediation":"L0pht AntiSniff 1.0.1 及更早版本存在此漏洞，厂商 @stake 已被收购且产品已停止维护。建议立即停止使用该产品，改用替代方案（如 Wireshark 等现代网络分析工具）。作为临时缓解措施，在网络边界防火墙上过滤入站 DNS 响应包，并对内网 DNS 流量启用深度包检测，限制非标准 DNS 响应类型的通过。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.l0pht.com/advisories/asniff_advisory.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/3179","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1207","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19918","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0405.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0405.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0405","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0405.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0405.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xvhj-83gv-vjmg/GHSA-xvhj-83gv-vjmg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0405.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001385.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0331.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0325","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0325.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0395","title":"Computalynx CProxy Server 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Computalynx CProxy Server 3.3 SP2 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送超长 HTTP 请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 CProxy Server 3.3 SP2 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，危害等级中危。目前已公开 PoC 利用代码，可验证该漏洞的存在。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0395"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:37.593","remediation":"建议立即升级 CProxy Server 至 3.3 SP2 以上版本（如厂商仍提供支持），或在网络边界防火墙中限制对 TCP 8080 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 段连接；同时部署入侵检测系统（IDS）规则检测超长 HTTP 请求（超过 247 字节的 GET 请求），拦截恶意载荷。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至仍在安全更新周期内的替代代理服务器产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1213","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=007d01bfbf48%24e44f0e40%2401dc11ac%40peopletel.org","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19920","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0395.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0395","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0395.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0395.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g5p4-qw97-m7r5/GHSA-g5p4-qw97-m7r5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0395.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001384.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--75c26508-413b-4a4d-8293-4e71f8cde752.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0325.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0323","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0323.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0393","title":"KDE kscd 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"KDE 桌面环境的 kscd（CD 播放器）程序在处理用户 SHELL 环境变量时存在权限提升漏洞。当用户通过 SHELL 环境变量指定替代程序时，kscd 未正确丢弃其特权权限，导致以提升后的权限执行用户指定的任意程序。攻击者可在本地利用该漏洞，通过设置恶意的 SHELL 环境变量并诱导 kscd 执行，从而获取目标系统的完全控制权限（包括读取、修改、删除任意文件及执行任意命令）。该漏洞影响 KDE 1.1、1.1.1、1.2 及 2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0393"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:37.347","remediation":"升级 KDE 至 2.0 以上版本，或安装对应发行版提供的 kscd 安全补丁。如无法升级，可移除 kscd 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /opt/kde/bin/kscd），或限制 kscd 仅允许受信任用户执行，同时在启动 kscd 前手动清除 SHELL 环境变量中的恶意路径作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0172.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_50.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1206","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19915","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0393.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0393","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0393.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0393.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ph8q-v7mf-3mfr/GHSA-ph8q-v7mf-3mfr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0393.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001383.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0323.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0320","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0320.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0389","title":"MIT Kerberos 4/5 krb_rd_req 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"MIT Kerberos 4 和 5 协议实现中的 krb_rd_req() 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的 Kerberos 认证请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程代码执行并以 root 权限控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 Cygnus Network Security 4.0、KerbNet 5.0、MIT Kerberos 4/5 及 RedHat 6.2 等版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Exploit-DB 上已有公开利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0389"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36.847","remediation":"建议立即升级 MIT Kerberos 至 1.2.x 或更高版本（krb5-1.1.1 及更早版本受影响），或安装对应发行版的安全补丁：Red Hat Linux 6.2 用户应应用 RHSA-2000-025 提供的更新 krb5 包；FreeBSD 用户应升级至 2000 年 5 月后的安全修复版本。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制对 Kerberos 服务端口（TCP/UDP 88、749）的未授权访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0184.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-05/0295.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-06.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-025.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1220","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19926","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0389.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0389","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0389.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0389.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3b3e0c6dace1e53ea2fb8cc49db3e38b834c9179/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4jvw-4fhr-v7mv/GHSA-4jvw-4fhr-v7mv.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/K/kerberos_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001381.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f31f31af-8610-4da2-9ce2-4cc8bbb2bc13.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0320.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0312","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0312.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0379","title":"Netopia R系列路由器 SNMP表修改漏洞","description":"Netopia R9100 及 R 系列路由器 4.6.2 版本存在 SNMP 表访问控制缺陷，即使管理员已配置禁止修改 SNMP 表，已认证的本地用户仍可绕过限制修改 SNMP 配置。攻击者需拥有路由器本地访问权限，利用该漏洞可篡改 SNMP MIB 表项，导致设备配置信息泄露或网络管理异常。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低，但暴露了路由器权限分离机制的不足。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0379"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:35.633","remediation":"Netopia R9100/R-series 路由器已停止维护，官方不再提供固件更新。建议立即更换为受支持的现代路由器产品。如无法更换，可采取以下缓解措施：1) 在路由器管理界面禁用 SNMP 写操作（SNMP write community）；2) 在防火墙层面限制仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问路由器的 SNMP 端口（UDP 161/162）；3) 将 SNMP 设置为只读模式，禁止通过 SNMP 修改配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.netopia.com/equipment/purchase/fmw_update.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1177","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200005082054.NAA32590%40linux.mtndew.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19901","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0379.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0379","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0379.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0379.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f085197f4312eebb5b5d2a4ae57205b512d529b1/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p59f-g5mj-4hqq/GHSA-p59f-g5mj-4hqq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0379.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001380.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0312.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0328","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0328.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0397","title":"Seattle Lab Software Emurl 2.0 会话标识可预测漏洞","description":"EMURL 是一款基于 Web 的电子邮件帐户管理软件，其用户会话 URL 中编码了可预测的标识符，导致远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过直接访问特制的 URL 来获取其他用户的电子邮件内容。该漏洞影响 Seattle Lab Software Emurl 2.0 版本，攻击者只需知道目标用户的会话 URL 模式即可实施攻击，可能导致用户邮件数据泄露。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0397"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-15T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:37.840","remediation":"Seattle Lab Software Emurl 2.0 已停止维护，建议立即迁移至受支持的现代 Web 邮件系统（如 Roundcube、SquirrelMail 等）。如无法立即迁移，可在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面为 /scripts/emurl/ 目录添加 IP 白名单访问控制或 HTTP 基本认证，限制对 RECMAN.dll 和 MAKEHTML_M.dll 的访问，防止未授权用户利用可预测的会话标识符访问他人邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0160.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1203","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19914","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0397.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0397","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0397.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0397.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xmvv-4vx6-5fqj/GHSA-xmvv-4vx6-5fqj.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0397.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6180dab5-9713-49ee-9b3a-c1812cdb1fb1.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8b2b9a8673bea39f5c895cdb2f43d026330c1de0/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0328.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0345","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0345.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0424","title":"George Burgyan CGI Counter 4.0.2/4.0.7 输入验证漏洞","description":"George Burgyan CGI Counter 4.0.2 和 4.0.7 版本存在输入验证漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意的查询字符串参数（如 \"count\" 参数）向 CGI 计数器程序发送特制请求，利用程序对用户输入缺乏有效过滤和验证，导致命令注入或任意命令执行。该漏洞影响使用受影响版本 CGI Counter 的 Web 服务器，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，通过构造包含 shell 元字符（如分号、反引号、管道符）的参数值，在服务器上以 Web 服务器进程权限执行任意系统命令，可能导致服务器完全被攻控。攻击条件为目标服务器部署了受影响版本的 CGI Counter 且 CGI 执行权限配置不当。攻击者可通过构造类似 `/cgi-bin/counter?count=;cat+/etc/passwd` 的恶意 URL 实现远程命令执行，获取服务器敏感信息或进一步控制服务器。建议升级至修复版本或禁用该 CGI 程序。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0424"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-15","updated":"2000-05-15","remediation":"立即将 George Burgyan CGI Counter 从 4.0.2/4.0.7 升级到最新可用版本或卸载该软件。该软件已停止维护，无法获得安全补丁。作为临时缓解措施，禁止访问 cgie/private 目录并限制 CGI 脚本执行权限至仅限 root 用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19913","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0424.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0424","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0424.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0424.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c2w5-h6v5-wf8j/GHSA-c2w5-h6v5-wf8j.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0424.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001378.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0345.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0345.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0345.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0474","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0474.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0435","title":"Allmanage 网站管理系统 管理员密码检索漏洞","description":"Allmanage Website administration software 2.6 包含一个文件上传 CGI 脚本 allmanageup.pl，该脚本存在权限验证漏洞。远程攻击者可以直接调用此脚本，无需任何身份验证，成功进入系统。攻击者可以修改管理员账户信息、网页内容，甚至可能篡改网站功能，导致网站安全完整性受到破坏。该漏洞攻击风险较高，受攻击面较广，主要影响那些使用 Allmanage 2.6 版本的管理系统，攻击者只需简单网络请求即可发起攻击，使用技术门槛较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0435"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-13T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:43.620","remediation":"建议立即升级 Allmanage Website Administration 软件至 2.6 以上版本或最新版本；若无法升级，请立即删除或禁用 allmanageup.pl 文件上传 CGI 脚本，或在 Web 服务器层面通过访问控制列表（ACL）禁止外部访问该脚本路径；同时配置 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）拦截针对 allmanageup.pl 的直接调用请求，并强制所有管理账户启用强密码策略和多因素认证作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0167.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1337","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1217","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0435.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0435","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0435.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0435.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vmcm-2hp4-rp5v/GHSA-vmcm-2hp4-rp5v.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1217/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0435.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--843eaeb1-57d6-4b1f-8ad5-4e09f2ce4751.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001376.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0474.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0474.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0474.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0330","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0330.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0400","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer Active Movie ActiveX 控件任意文件下载漏洞","description":"Microsoft Active Movie ActiveX 控件（随 Internet Explorer 5 分发）存在输入验证不当漏洞，该控件未对可下载的文件类型进行任何限制。远程攻击者可通过将恶意文件编码在电子邮件或新闻组帖子中，诱使用户在 IE 中查看包含该 ActiveX 控件的内容，从而将任意类型的文件（包括可执行文件）下载到用户系统上。成功利用此漏洞可导致任意代码执行、敏感信息泄露或拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证，仅需用户交互（如预览邮件或点击链接）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0400"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-13T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:38.210","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-033 提供的综合补丁，或升级至 Internet Explorer 5.01 Service Pack 1 及以上版本（IE 5.5 不受影响）。如无法打补丁，可通过注册表为 ActiveMovieControl Object (CLSID: 05589FA0-C356-11CE-BF01-00AA0055595A) 设置 Kill Bit 来禁用该 ActiveX 控件，防止任意文件下载攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95868514521257&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1221","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19928","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0400.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0400","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0400.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0400.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wq95-mwj7-34mh/GHSA-wq95-mwj7-34mh.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0400.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68